'''Siroi''' (Suroi) is a [[Rai Coast languages|Rai Coast]] language spoken in [[Madang Province]], [[Papua New Guinea]], and a local trade language. It is spoken in Kumisanger village ({{coord|-5.49683|145.997999|type:city_region:PG|name=Kumisanger}}), [[Astrolabe Bay Rural LLG]], [[Madang Province]].<ref name=e25/><ref name="UN-PNG">{{cite web |url=https://data.humdata.org/dataset/village-coordinates-lookup |title=Papua New Guinea Village Coordinates Lookup |author=United Nations in Papua New Guinea |work=Humanitarian Data Exchange |version=1.31.9 |date=2018}}</ref>

